\ls12\ilvl1
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\i \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Dietary Habits: 
\f1\i0 Most Americans do not maintain a healthy diet, with poor eating habits often starting from infancy.\
\ls12\ilvl1\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\i \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Sodium: 
\f1\i0 Many Americans consume insufficient fruits and vegetables while exceeding recommended sodium intake.\
\ls12\ilvl1\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\i \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Obesity: 
\f1\i0 A significant portion of the US population, both children and adults, are obese, leading to increased healthcare costs and health risks.\
