\f2\i \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Food Group Benefits: 
\f1\i0 Simplify dietary recommendations by focusing on foods instead of nutrients.\
\ls37\ilvl1\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\i \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone USDA Food Patterns:
\f1\i0  Provide recommended amounts of each food group and subgroup at 12 different calorie levels.\
\ls37\ilvl1\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
