\f1\i0  Each pattern includes a limited number of calories for added sugars and saturated fats.\
\pard\tx216\tx432\pardeftab560\li432\fi-432\sa360\partightenfactor0
\ls39\ilvl1\cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\i \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Nutrient-Dense Food Choices: 
\f1\i0 Americans are encouraged to choose nutrient-dense foods and limit added sugars and saturated fat to less than 10% of total calorie intake.\
