\ls40\ilvl1\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\i \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Caloric Needs:
\f1\i0  Caloric intake should be based on individual energy requirements, which can be estimated using formulas like BMR or dietary reference intake.\
