\ls43\ilvl1
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone A diet is anything that is consumed by a person or people on a regular basis.\
