\ls45\ilvl1
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\i \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Acceptable Macronutrient Distribution Range (AMDR): 
\f1\i0 The AMDR describes the proportions of daily caloric intake that should be carbohydrates, lipids (fat), and proteins. Basically, the AMDR provides guidelines on how many macronutrient calories one should consume a day.\
\ls45\ilvl1\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cb4 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone According to the AMDR, the range of caloric intake in a daily diet should be:\
