\ls79\ilvl2\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Includes the statement of identity, ingredients list, nutritional facts (calories, macronutrients, micronutrients), and allergen information.\
\ls79\ilvl2\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Lists all ingredients in descending order of weight.\
