\ls81\ilvl3\cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \'93Low-calorie\'94 is 40 calories or less per serving.\
\ls81\ilvl3\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \'93Low-cholesterol\'94 is 20 mg or less and 2 g or less of saturated fat per serving.\
\ls81\ilvl3\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \'93Reduced\'94 is at least 25% less of the specified nutrient or calories than the usual product.\
\ls81\ilvl3\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \'93Good source of\'94 provides at least 10 to 19% of the DV of a particular vitamin or nutrient per serving.\
\ls81\ilvl3\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \'93Excellent source of\'94 provides at least 20% or more of the DV of a particular vitamin or nutrient per serving.\
