\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone After the food is finished absorption through the small intestine, it passes through the large intestine. While in the large intestine, the food is fermented and formed into waste to be later excreted. \cb4 The only absorption that occurs within the large intestine is remaining water and electrolytes.\
