\f2\i \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Muscular Endurance:
\f1\i0  ability to exert a force over a period of time or repetitions.\
\ls171\ilvl0\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\i \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Muscular Strength:
